# The leakage follows the profile that emits a Gaussian matched to the fibre, up to what the etch can provide.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Gaussian-apodised grating, leakage limited to 2 per um
grating angle=10 length=30
leak 2.0
apodise gaussian
expect radiated 0.99900000 1e-06
expect overlap 0.99999994 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.49949997 2e-05
expect position 15.00000000 0.005
expect efficiency_db -3.01465 0.0005
